⍝ Take.tc
⍝ ═══════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: A simple scalar/vector integer
      ⍝ inv: ⍴Z ←→ |,A
      ⍝ inv: ⍴⍴Z ←→ ⍴,A
      B ← ⎕RVAL 2 (5 6) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      A ← ⎕RVAL 1 (,2) (,0 1 0 0 0)          ⍝ 2-element take vector
      A ← 1+3∣|A                              ⍝ values 1..4 (fit within shape)
      Z ← A↑B
      (⍴Z) ≡ |,A
1
      (⍴⍴Z) ≡ ⍴,A
1
      ⍝ inv: A↑B ←→ A↑[⍳⍴⍴B]B
      B ← ⎕RVAL 2 (5 6) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      A ← 2 3
      (A↑B) ≡ A↑[⍳⍴⍴B]B
1
